{"id":"anstrengend","lemma":"anstrengend","pos":"adj","rank":3198,"glosses":["strenuous (requiring great exertion)","exhausting"],"ipa":"/ˈanˌʃtʁɛŋənt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2b/De-anstrengend.ogg/De-anstrengend.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"anstrengender","superlative":"am anstrengendsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Heute war ein anstrengender Tag.","en":"Today was a tiring day.","words":[{"g":"today"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"day"}]},{"text":"Das wird sehr anstrengend sein.","en":"Doing that will be very tiring.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"very"},null,{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Ich finde Laufen anstrengend.","en":"I find running exhausting.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to find","l":"finden"},{"g":"to walk"},null]},{"text":"Diese Aufgabe ist anstrengend.","en":"This is a demanding task.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"duty"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Meine neue Arbeit ist anstrengender als meine alte.","en":"My new job is harder than my old one.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"toil"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"age, old age","l":"Alter"}]}]}